meta {
  name: List TACOTS Students for Profile dropdown
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lookup/tacots-students-profile?page=1&limit=10&orderBy=asc&search=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  orderBy: asc
  search: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List TACOTS Students for Profile Dropdown
  
  Returns a paginated, searchable list of TACOTS students who have been onboarded and have `SELECTED` admin status, for use in student profile components. Joins `tacots_onboarding` with `tacots_recommendation` (inner join on `SELECTED` status) and left joins `tacots_exit`. Each entry contains the student `id` (from `tacots_recommendation`) and `name` (first name + surname).
  The sorting behavoir is such that tacotsRecommendation records without a related tacotsExit record are listed first, then tacotsRecommendation records with a tacotsExit record. Within each group, records are ordered by tacotsRecommendation.firstName.

  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication and `read` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type     | Required | Default | Description                                         |
  |-----------|----------|----------|---------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `page`    | `number` | No       | `1`     | Page number for pagination.                         |
  | `limit`   | `number` | No       | `10`    | Number of results per page.                         |
  | `orderBy` | `string` | No       | `asc`   | Sort direction by first name (`asc` or `desc`).     |
  | `search`  | `string` | No       | —       | Full-text search on first name and surname. Bypasses cache when provided. |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns an array of `{ id, name }` objects with pagination metadata.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "students found successfully",
    "data": [
      { "id": "uuid", "name": "Jane Doe" }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 10,
        "totalPages": 2
      },
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  | Field  | Type     | Description                                                      |
  |--------|----------|------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `id`   | `string` | The recommendation record UUID (used as student profile ID).     |
  | `name` | `string` | Full name (first name + surname) from the recommendation record. |
  
  ## Caching
  Response is cached under `cedarrise:lookup:tacotsstudents:{page}:{limit}:{orderBy}` with `STUDENT_PROFILE` TTL (5 mins). Cache is bypassed when `search` is provided.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                    |
  |-----------------------------|--------------------------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid auth token. |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User lacks `read` permission.  |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.       |
}
